  "description": "The Molly allows you to cruise in comfort and style. Built around a lightweight aluminum step through frame to make mounting and dismounting effortless. Features a comfortable Creme saddle with springs, gummy grips, a wicker basket, thick stays and leather washers. Clothes stay clean and dry in all-weather conditions thanks to full-coverage, durable mudguards and chain guard. A 3-speed Shimano Nexus internal hub is the epitome of quality, versatility, and simplicity. Innova 26” tires are perfect for commuting, with a round profile to handle anything in the city. Safety at night thanks to front and rear lights included with the bike. Finished in eye-catching glossy paint in Midnight Gold and Gold Chic.",
